    "title": {
      "type": "i18n",
      "default_language": "en",
      "values": {
        "en": "Quadratic Expression of the First Fundamental Form",
        "zh-CN": "第一基本形式的二次式"
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "snl": "variable[default](__list__[default]($\\mathcal C_X$@DG.ctxt.surfaceParametrization,DG.def.regularParametrizedSurface[text](X,$\\Omega$),Type.annotation[colon](@q,LA.def.realVecSpaceRn[default]($2$)),Set.Mem[default](LA.def.realVecSpaceRn[default]($2$),$\\Omega$,q),Type.annotation[colon](__list__[formula](@a,@b),Real[default])),Eq[default](Real[default],DG.def.firstFundamentalForm[default](X,q,Add.add[infix](LA.Smul[default](a,Type.apply[paren](DG.def.partialDeriv[default](X,$1$),q)),LA.Smul[default](b,Type.apply[paren](DG.def.partialDeriv[default](X,$2$),q))),Add.add[infix](LA.Smul[default](a,Type.apply[paren](DG.def.partialDeriv[default](X,$1$),q)),LA.Smul[default](b,Type.apply[paren](DG.def.partialDeriv[default](X,$2$),q)))),Add.add[infix](Add.add[infix](Mul.mul[implicit](Type.apply[paren](DG.firstFundamentalE[default](X),q),Power[sup](a,$2$)),Mul.mul[implicit](Mul.mul[implicit](Mul.mul[implicit]($2$,Type.apply[paren](DG.firstFundamentalF[default](X),q)),a),b)),Mul.mul[implicit](Type.apply[paren](DG.firstFundamentalG[default](X),q),Power[sup](b,$2$)))))",
      "markdown": {
        "type": "i18n",
        "default_language": "en",
        "values": {
          "en": "Let $\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2$ be Euclidean open and $X:\\mathbb R^2\\to\\mathbb R^3$ be smooth and regular on $\\Omega$. At $q\\in\\Omega$, put $U=X_u(q)$ and $V=X_v(q)$; these form a basis of $T_qX$. For all $a,b\\in\\mathbb R$, $w=aU+bV$ satisfies $\\mathrm I_X(q;w,w)=Ea^2+2Fab+Gb^2$. Here $E=E_X(q),F=F_X(q),G=G_X(q)$.",
          "zh-CN": "设 $\\Omega\\subseteq\\mathbb R^2$ 为欧氏开集，$X:\\mathbb R^2\\to\\mathbb R^3$ 在 $\\Omega$ 上光滑且正则。取 $q\\in\\Omega$，记 $U=X_u(q)$、$V=X_v(q)$，它们构成 $T_qX$ 的一组基。任意 $a,b\\in\\mathbb R$ 给出 $w=aU+bV$，有 $\\mathrm I_X(q;w,w)=Ea^2+2Fab+Gb^2$。其中 $E=E_X(q),F=F_X(q),G=G_X(q)$。"
        }
      }
    },
